---
title: "Agent Spine: Deterministic Workflow DAG Engine"
date: "2026-06-21"
excerpt: "How agent-spine enforces structured execution through YAML-defined DAG pipelines, immutable snapshots, parallel fan-out, and human-in-the-loop approval gates."
slug: "agent-spine-workflow-engine"
